{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Brave New World of the Internet", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Troubleshooting", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Dealing  With Problems: Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. It is particularly useful if you want to discuss a complicated technical problem.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "If you have a conversation about technical issues, you can use modals like  <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to suggest solutions and offer assistance. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">I would ... <br/> I wouldn't ... <br/> You could ... </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">You might want to ... <br/>You must ...<br/> Always check ...<br/></span><br/> These are examples of a technical assistant giving suggestions about how to deal with technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "First, you should power down your computer for a few minutes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Wait until it has completely cooled down.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to write this down. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If it still doesn't work, you could try downloading the latest version of the Wi-Fi driver.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I would upgrade to a newer W-Fi component.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Discussing Problems: Asking for Help or Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this.  Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You can use the structure:<br/>   <span class=\"strong\">Can</span>/<span class=\"strong\">Could</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">Do</span> + <span class=\"strong\">you</span> + <span class=\"strong\">verb</span> + <span class=\"strong\"> me (optional)</span> + <span class=\"strong\">question word</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how this computer works?<br/> Could you tell me where I can download the latest driver?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also suggest advice by using the same structure:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Do you know where to go online to download the driver?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These questions suggest solutions related to technical issues. They are often used in user manuals or troubleshooting booklets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Modal Can/Could/Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Question Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" tell (me)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">what</span> to do?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" show (me)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> to check if it's working?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> to reboot your computer?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">where</span> you can download the latest driver?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also use the structure<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Let me show</span>/ <span class=\"strong\">tell</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">you</span> +  <span class=\"strong\">question word</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Let me show you how to make this computer work.</span.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Could you tell me what to do if the router still doesn't work?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Let me tell you how to troubleshoot this issue.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "It's all Greek to me!", "type": "name"}, {"content": " I can't understand anything at all!", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've read the instructions manual, but it's all Greek to me!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in a conversation about an Internet problem.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reboot", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to start a computer again after a problem", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you try rebooting your computer?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to power down ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to shut down an electronic device completely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should power down your computer for a few minutes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "version", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a particular form of software different from earlier forms of the same thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Which router software version do you have?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to download", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to copy data from the Internet into a computer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could try downloading the latest version.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "warranty", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period during which repairs on a device are made free of charge", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should be able to get it for free if your computer is under warranty. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to troubleshoot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fix an electronic problem", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let me help you troubleshoot this issue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to upgrade", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get a newer version of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would upgrade to a newer router.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "component", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of electronic equipment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The problem might come from your laptop's Wi-Fi component.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "driver", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a program that runs particular tasks in a computer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure you have the latest version of the Wi-Fi driver.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le10ob10aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and find instruction manuals for devices that you use every day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look for the FAQ (frequently asked questions) and the troubleshooting section.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write your own troubleshooting manual (10 - 14 lines). Think of 4 technical problems you want to solve.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each problem, provide a solution using modals or expressions suggesting advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your partner's troubleshooting manual. Ask for clarification if you don't understand how to deal with your partner's technical problems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about technology and technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I offer advice and suggestions to deal with technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification about technical problems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le10ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    Hello? Vanessa? Are you still on the line?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Yes, I'm still here. I really need this router to work! I've done everything you suggested, but there is no signal improvement. I've read the instructions manual, but it's all Greek to me!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    Let me tell you how to troubleshoot this issue. Did you try rebooting your computer? The problem might come from your laptop's Wi-Fi component.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Can you tell me what to do to see if that's the case?"}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "27800", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    First, you should power down your computer for a few minutes. Wait until it has completely cooled down. Then, you should switch it on again and check the quality of the signal.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Hang on, you're going too fast.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    No worries. You might want to write this down. If it still doesn't work, you could try downloading the latest version of the Wi-Fi driver."}, {"image": "engenn7le10ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "49800", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Could you tell me what to do if it still doesn't work? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    I would upgrade to a newer Wi-Fi component. You should be able to get it for free if your computer is under warranty. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    That sounds like a lot of trouble. Hang on! The router works now! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:    Fantastic! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Yeah. Thanks so much for your help!<br/>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le10ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le10ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you read operation manuals before you start using an electronic device? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you ever called a hotline for help on technical problems? Were they able to solve your problem?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Did you read the manual? Do you need to call the hotline?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_pa